<title>UK: BASKETBALL-MEN'S EUROLEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-MEN'S EUROLEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on Thursday of men's</p>
<p>EuroLeague basketball matches:</p>
<p>In Istanbul:</p>
<p>Group A </p>
<p>Ulker Spor (Turkey) 84 Maccabi Tel Aviv (Israel) 80</p>
<p>(halftime 36-39)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Ulker Spor - Alibegovic 19, Erdanay 18</p>
<p>Maccabi Tel Aviv - Kattash 19, Radovic 12</p>
<p>In Istanbul</p>
<p>Group D:</p>
<p>Efes Pilsen (Turkey) 69 CDB Sevilla (Spain) 66 (37-35)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Efes Pilsen - Naumowski 22, Sarica 15</p>
<p>CDB Sevilla - Anderson 21, Carney 16</p>
<p>In Moscow:</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>CSKA Moscow (Russia) 74 Limoges (France) 65 (40-29)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>CSKA - Igor Kudelin 20, Sergei Panov 17</p>
<p>Limoges - Vern Fleming 14, Gerald Glass 13</p>
<p>In Milan:</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>Stefanel Milano (Italy) 90 Panionios (Greece) 66 (49-46)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Stefanel - Warren Kidd 15, Flavio Portaluppi 14, Anthony</p>
<p>Bowie 13</p>
<p>Panionios - Miroslav Petsarsky 22, Fanis Christodoulou 11,</p>
<p>Mitchell Wiggins 10</p>
<p>Attendance - 2.700</p>
<p>In Split:</p>
<p>Group C</p>
<p>Croatia Osiguranje (Croatia) 53  Smelt Olimpija (Slovenia)</p>
<p>66 (31-38)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Croatia Osiguranje - Nikola Vujicic 15, Damir Tvrdic 14</p>
<p>Smelt Olimpija - Marko Tusek 18, Marko Milic 14</p>
<p>In Athens:</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>Olympiakos (Greece) 110 Estudiantes (Spain) 78 (53-46)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Olympiakos - Dimitris Papanikolaou 19, Panayotis Fasoulas 18, Willy Anderson 16</p>
<p>Estudiantes - Harper Williams 22, Ignacio Azofra 11, Ignacio de Miguel 10</p>
<p>Attendance: 8,000  </p>
<p>In Pau:</p>
<p>Group D</p>
<p>Pau-Orthez (France) 89 Virtus Bologna (Italy) 83 (45-35)</p>
<p>Leading scorers</p>
<p>Pau - Antoine Rigaudeau 25, Thierry Gadou 21, Fabien Dubos 11</p>
<p>Virtus Bologna - Zoran Savic 25, Bane Prelevic 19, Arija Komazec 18</p>
<p>Attendance: 7,000  </p>
<p>In Leverkusen:</p>
<p>Group C</p>
<p>Bayer Leverkusen (Germany) 67 Panathinaikos (Greece) 78</p>
<p>(35-36)</p>
<p>Attendance 3,500</p>
</text>
